 checkpointer kya  karta hai ?
 checkpointer means graph during execution state ko persist/save karna,
  taaki workflow ko later resume ya inspect kiya ja sake.

  iska use hota hai :
  conversation  memory
  long-running agents
  resume after failure
  Human-in-the-loop
  Debugging
  Multiple turns
  Stateful agents


